      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i've read so many things about how much better people feel on mega-doses of vit c for their energy and detox. i really want to go for it because i feel like my immune system is always low too. if i just make sure i drink a ton of water throughout the day, doesn't that basically offset the oxalate risk? like, if the water flushes it out, shouldn't the high dose be fine for the benefits?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
